#! program build/docs-examples/bin/tut24_editor
#! fresh   /tmp/figure-studio
#! args    --examples /tmp/figure-studio --case /tmp/figure-studio/plate
#! frames  460
#! poster  200
#! crop    0 0 1100 680
#! keys
# The Input panel, the heat.inp tab: the namelist in the code editor. A double-click selects omega and a typo is typed
# over it: the line is marked, Apply is greyed out, the mark's message under the pointer. The name typed again, the
# mark goes. F1: the Help window, its sections and tables, scrolled with the wheel; its link to the body selects Body in
# the input's tree
0   wait
0   move 600 300
10  move 37 115 12
25  down
26  up
45  move 605 80 12
60  down
61  up
85  move 636 225 15
105 down
106 up
108 down
109 up
130 text omgea
150 move 556 225 15
230 move 636 225 10
245 down
246 up
248 down
249 up
265 text omega
300 move 700 400 10
315 key f1
345 move 560 300 10
360 wheel 0 -3
375 wheel 0 -3
395 move 340 326 10
410 down
411 up
